[00:00.00]Jambalaya (On The Bayou) - Carpenters (卡朋特乐队)
[00:04.00]
[00:04.00]Lyrics by：Hank Williams
[00:08.00]
[00:08.00]Composed by：Hank Williams
[00:12.00]
[00:12.00]Good-bye Joe he gotta go me oh my oh
[00:12.00:zh]再见乔，他要启程，哦我的天
[00:17.00]He gotta go-pole the pirogue down the bayou
[00:17.00:zh]他要划着独木舟，顺流驶向河口沼泽
[00:22.00]His Yvonne the sweetest one me oh my oh
[00:22.00:zh]伊冯是他最甜美的姑娘，哦我的天
[00:27.00]Son of a gun we'll have big fun on the bayou
[00:27.00:zh]好家伙，我们要在河畔尽情欢乐
[00:32.00]Thibodaux Fontaineaux the place is buzzin'
[00:32.00:zh]蒂博多、方托诺，处处热闹喧嚣
[00:37.00]A kinfolk come to see Yvonne by the dozen
[00:37.00:zh]亲朋好友成群结伴，前来探望伊冯
[00:42.00]Dressed in style they go hog wild me oh my oh
[00:42.00:zh]盛装打扮，尽情狂欢，哦我的天
[00:47.00]Son of a gun we'll have big fun on the bayou
[00:47.00:zh]好家伙，我们要在河畔尽情欢乐
[00:52.00]Jambalaya crawfish pie and fillet gumbo
[00:52.00:zh]什锦烩饭、小龙虾派、秋葵肉片浓汤
[00:57.00]For tonight I'm-a gonna see my ma cher a mi-o
[00:57.00:zh]今夜，我就要见到我心爱的姑娘
[01:02.00]Pick guitar fill fruit jar and be gay-o
[01:02.00:zh]弹起吉他，装满果酒，开怀欢畅
[01:06.00]Son of a gun we'll have big fun on the bayou
[01:06.00:zh]好家伙，我们要在河畔尽情欢乐
[01:31.00]Settle down far from town get him a pirogue
[01:31.00:zh]远离城镇安居，给他备一艘独木小舟
[01:36.00]And he'll catch all the fish in the bayou
[01:36.00:zh]他能在河口沼泽捕到满满一船鱼
[01:41.00]Swap his mon to buy Yvonne what she need-o
[01:41.00:zh]卖掉渔获，为伊冯买下她想要的一切
